Before you push, verify:

1. `make up` — Postgres and Redis start, healthchecks go green.
2. `make test-unit` — passes (empty test suite is fine for now).
3. `make test-integration` — passes (empty test suite is fine for now).
4. `make build` — produces `bin/nexus`.
5. `make lint` — passes.
6. Push to GitHub — CI workflow goes green.

